WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:17,060
Yun Zhenbian must have noticed that the little master is about to awaken.

2
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,830
Then he took her away

3
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:21,430
If it weren’t for the young master

4
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:23,530
Why should I lurk until now?

5
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:26,990
Zhen and Shi and the others

6
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:28,190
I'm still sure

7
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,790
But over there at Yun Town

8
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:41,540
It's been a long time since I've used this leather bag.

9
00:00:41,540 --> 00:01:09,620
Finally, when he came, he changed his name to Martial Saint.

10
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:11,620
Not a joke

11
00:01:11,620 --> 00:01:14,970
To win over or to get rid of?

12
00:01:14,970 --> 00:01:16,970
Let’s see how the general manager decides.

13
00:01:16,970 --> 00:01:19,500
Guest officer please come inside

14
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,100
One seat
